msgid ""
"[`open-deploy-ws` `.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/blob/main/.gitmodules) pins `src/robot-descriptions` to "
"**`main`**. **Taku is not on `main`.**"
msgstr ""
"[`open-deploy-ws` 的 `.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/blob/main/.gitmodules) 把 `src/robot-descriptions` 钉在 "
"**`main`**。**Taku 不在 `main` 上。**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:132
#: 7e2ec3748155406fb44442d10d82b4e0
msgid ""
"The in-tree package lives at "
"[`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/tree/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description)"
" on **`feature/agilex`** ([package README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md))."
" After a normal init (or the HTTPS clone of `robot_descriptions` on "
"`main`):"
msgstr ""
"仓内包在 **`feature/agilex`** 的 "
"[`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/tree/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description)（[包"
" README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md)）。常规初始化之后（或"
" HTTPS 克隆了 `main` 上的 `robot_descriptions` 之后）："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:134
#: 7cdc0f9863a84bb2909c8d6970d7987e
msgid ""
"cd src/robot-descriptions\n"
"git fetch origin\n"
"git checkout feature/agilex\n"
"# common is required (sensor_models / robot_common_launch)\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-common.git "
"common\n"
"# or, if SSH works: git submodule update --init common"
msgstr ""
"cd src/robot-descriptions\n"
"git fetch origin\n"
"git checkout feature/agilex\n"
"# common is required (sensor_models / robot_common_launch)\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-common.git "
"common\n"
"# or, if SSH works: git submodule update --init common"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:143
#: 16e18993312d4311825064a6b511ef80
msgid ""
"If you are starting from a clean HTTPS tree, clone descriptions on that "
"branch in one step: `git clone -b feature/agilex https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot_descriptions.git src/robot-descriptions`."
msgstr ""
"若从干净的 HTTPS 树开始，一步克隆该分支的描述：`git clone -b feature/agilex "
"https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_descriptions.git src/robot-"
"descriptions`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:145
#: 8f56b53a5ead40c891cd3b1f2a45e844
msgid ""
"Verified launch keys from that package README (`robot:=taku` → "
"`taku_description`):"
msgstr "该包 README 中已核实的启动键（`robot:=taku` → `taku_description`）："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:147
#: c6b75f626caf44c892b9ed566e6c84c1
msgid ""
"colcon build --packages-up-to taku_description sensor_models --symlink-"
"install\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=taku"
msgstr ""
"colcon build --packages-up-to taku_description sensor_models --symlink-"
"install\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=taku"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:153
#: 07f5c3688ae64cd0b3b42f09d16d156e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Control launches from that package README §3.1 / §3.2 (after descriptions"
" on `feature/agilex`). Default `hardware:=mock_components`. Layout has no"
" chassis or per-arm basic controllers. Dynaclaw uses "
"`adaptive_gripper_controller` (`left/right_gripper_controller`; joints "
"`*_gripper_joint` with a mimic jaw in URDF). Meshes live under "
"`meshes/{chassis,body,head,arm,dynaclaw}/`."
msgstr ""
"控制启动见该包 README §3.1 / §3.2（描述已切到 `feature/agilex` 之后）。默认 "
"`hardware:=mock_components`。布局没有底盘或单臂 basic 控制器。Dynaclaw 使用 "
"`adaptive_gripper_controller`（`left/right_gripper_controller`；关节为 "
"`*_gripper_joint`，URDF 里另一侧爪为 mimic）。网格在 "
"`meshes/{chassis,body,head,arm,dynaclaw}/`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:155
#: 472f166e45904dcab6b47d7e529a03bb
msgid ""
"colcon build --packages-up-to ocs2_arm_controller taku_description\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"# 分体 — public mock path (arm MPC + body/head basic + grippers)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=taku\n"
"# 全身 — needs the private ocs2_wbc_controller submodule\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=taku"
msgstr ""
"colcon build --packages-up-to ocs2_arm_controller taku_description\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"# 分体 — public mock path (arm MPC + body/head basic + grippers)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=taku\n"
"# 全身 — needs the private ocs2_wbc_controller submodule\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=taku"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:164
#: ba36aaf1694b459aa70ac3cb9d065910
msgid "Public mock vs private WBC"
msgstr "公开 mock 与私有 WBC"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:167
#: 47de890174c64069813c574e3f2065a0
msgid ""
"Shipping `config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` in the public description does"
" **not** mean public mock can run `ocs2_wbc_controller`. Public mock uses"
" **`split_body.launch.py`**. **`full_body.launch.py`** needs the private "
"WBC submodule."
msgstr ""
"公开描述里有 `config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` **并不表示**公开 mock 能跑 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`。公开 mock 用 **`split_body.launch.py`**。**`full_body.launch.py`** "
"需要私有 WBC 子模块。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:164
#: b04f95155f83445f9f80a75beb863983
msgid "Launch"
msgstr "启动"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:164
#: 60039ae61a9143ffa65498c3f711ee9c
msgid "Controllers"
msgstr "控制器"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:164
#: b7c6288494544dd4b1d87a402bf35f25
msgid "`split_body.launch.py`"
msgstr "`split_body.launch.py`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:164
#: ef686863b25b46b593c5933fbcb6201c
msgid ""
"`ocs2_arm_controller` (dual-arm MPC, `info_file_name: task`) + "
"`body_joint_controller` (`folding_low/high` + `waist_pitch/yaw`) + "
"`head_joint_controller` (`head_yaw/pitch/roll`) + grippers"
msgstr ""
"`ocs2_arm_controller`（双臂 MPC，`info_file_name: task`）+ "
"`body_joint_controller`（`folding_low/high` + `waist_pitch/yaw`）+ "
"`head_joint_controller`（`head_yaw/pitch/roll`）+ 夹爪"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:164
#: 79533a4bb21e422797de9f13402d90d1
msgid "`full_body.launch.py`"
msgstr "`full_body.launch.py`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:164
#: 985a22cd156741cfa298f005ca580bea
msgid ""
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` (body + dual arms + head, `info_file_name: "
"fixed_base_tcp`) + grippers"
msgstr ""
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`（身体 + 双臂 + 头，`info_file_name: "
"fixed_base_tcp`）+ 夹爪"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:175
#: df03dfcb6e314cf794f5d519c7babb8d
msgid ""
"When that config and the private module are present, full-body default "
"`headMode` is **`HEAD_GAZE`** (gaze on `head_camera_mid_optical_frame`). "
"`target_manager.yaml` has `enable_head_control: false`, so the head "
"follows OCS2 rather than a joint-space marker. Split-body still teleops "
"the head through `head_joint_controller` (RViz joint panel). Taku body-"
"relative rest is around x≈−0.21, not Bot2 `[0, 0.25]`."
msgstr ""
"当该配置和私有模块都在时，全身默认 `headMode` 是 **`HEAD_GAZE`**（注视 "
"`head_camera_mid_optical_frame`）。`target_manager.yaml` 里 "
"`enable_head_control: false`，因此头跟随 OCS2，而不是关节空间 marker。分体仍通过 "
"`head_joint_controller`（RViz 关节面板）遥操头部。Taku 身体相对静止位大约在 x≈−0.21，不是 "
"Bot2 的 `[0, 0.25]`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:177
#: 3b7b8bd69a8b4307989290fc9767c443
msgid ""
"In RViz, set **Fixed Frame** to **`base_link`** (or the coincident "
"`base_footprint`). OCS2 `baseFrame` / markers use `base_link`. There is "
"**no** `hardware:=mock` — the default key is `mock_components`. "
"`hardware:=gz` may need a GPU; mock + RViz is the default verify path. "
"The package README also lists `hardware:=isaac` on the same split / full "
"launches."
msgstr ""
"在 RViz 中把 **Fixed Frame** 设为 **`base_link`**（或重合的 `base_footprint`）。OCS2 "
"的 `baseFrame` / marker 使用 `base_link`。**没有** `hardware:=mock` — 默认键是 "
"`mock_components`。`hardware:=gz` 可能需要 GPU；默认验证路径是 mock + RViz。包 README "
"在同一套分体 / 全身启动上也列出了 `hardware:=isaac`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:179
#: c3758e193e6043e0a78135d9ab3110b5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`ocs2_arm_controller` `split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` use "
"the same `robot:=<key>` → `{key}_description` lookup. Taku ships "
"`config/ocs2/` (`task.info` for split, `fixed_base_tcp.info` for full-"
"body) and a ros2_control yaml that names `ocs2_arm_controller` / "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`, so `robot:=taku` is the same convention — not a "
"special-cased flag."
msgstr ""
"`ocs2_arm_controller` 的 `split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` 使用同一套 "
"`robot:=<key>` → `{key}_description` 查找。Taku 带有 `config/ocs2/`（分体用 "
"`task.info`，全身用 `fixed_base_tcp.info`）以及点名 `ocs2_arm_controller` / "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller` 的 ros2_control yaml，因此 `robot:=taku` 是同一约定 — "
"不是单独特判的参数。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:181
#: 1f14a51c12b54150ac7a811ac84330fb
msgid ""
"The description is **inferred** (public Dyna kinematics; not official "
"Dyna specs). That is stated in the package README."
msgstr "该描述是**推断**的（公开的 Dyna 运动学；不是官方 Dyna 规格）。包 README 写明了这一点。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:183
#: a1801ff5a76d4fe2b9e6f569dabf8ba3
msgid "Empty private directories and `COLCON_IGNORE`"
msgstr "空的私有目录与 `COLCON_IGNORE`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:185
#: d256f8bf5f27432e9cf6f47c441f60bd
msgid ""
"In **public** mode, `./init_repo.sh` skips private nested modules listed "
"in [`submodules_visibility.conf`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/blob/main/submodules_visibility.conf). Under "
"`src/arms_ros2_control` those placeholders stay empty, including:"
msgstr ""
"**public** 模式下，`./init_repo.sh` 会跳过 "
"[`submodules_visibility.conf`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/blob/main/submodules_visibility.conf) 里列出的私有嵌套模块。在 "
"`src/arms_ros2_control` 下这些占位目录会保持为空，包括："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:187
#: 439a7ecfc364491e90da1f997859d541
msgid "`controller/ocs2_wbc_controller`"
msgstr "`controller/ocs2_wbc_controller`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:188
#: 147045cec4c045cdbd37178357af2abd
msgid "`libraries/lina_planning`"
msgstr "`libraries/lina_planning`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:189
#: dc9c70135b8e46438eac7576ced5b21c
