#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:263
#: e00874278569440b9c43d75ff91dc483
msgid ""
"Not `gripper:=`. Symmetric: `type:=<eef_key>`. Different L/R: "
"`left_type:=` / `right_type:=` together (**do not pass `type:=`** then). "
"Profile `defaults.end_effectors` is used when `use_profile_eef:=true` "
"(default). See "
"[robot_common_launch](../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)."
msgstr ""
"不是 `gripper:=`。对称末端：`type:=<eef_key>`。左右不同：同时传 `left_type:=` / "
"`right_type:=`（此时**不要再传 `type:=`**）。`use_profile_eef:=true`（默认）时使用 "
"profile 的 `defaults.end_effectors`。见 "
"[robot_common_launch](../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)。"

