#: b73ddba3202749eca01058833d8110f6
msgid "Verify the submodule is listed as public in `submodules_visibility.conf`"
msgstr "确认该子模块在 `submodules_visibility.conf` 中列为公开"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:306
#: 554b1e0b915f4d1abb76f1f52f13dd7d
msgid ""
"If an empty private dir still breaks colcon, re-run `./init_repo.sh` so "
"it writes `COLCON_IGNORE`, or `touch <empty-dir>/COLCON_IGNORE`"
msgstr ""
"若空的私有目录仍导致 colcon 失败，再跑 `./init_repo.sh` 让它写入 `COLCON_IGNORE`，或 `touch "
"<empty-dir>/COLCON_IGNORE`"

